# ── .wolf/ — each dev keeps their own local OpenWolf state ────────────────────
# All these files mutate every Claude session and conflict cross-team.
# Kept tracked: OPENWOLF.md, identity.md, config.json, cron-manifest.json,
# reframe-frameworks.md, hooks/*.js, hooks/package.json (static, shared).
.wolf/memory.md
.wolf/anatomy.md
.wolf/cerebrum.md
.wolf/buglog.json
.wolf/token-ledger.json
.wolf/cron-state.json
.wolf/designqc-report.json
.wolf/designqc-captures/
.wolf/suggestions.json
.wolf/hooks/_session.json

# ── Flutter desktop runner dirs (regenerate locally per OS) ───────────────────
flutter_app/windows/
flutter_app/macos/
flutter_app/linux/

# ── clangd index cache ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
